Sita rejoices like rain-fed earth and begs touch of Rama --- Sita adds crow reed and cheek tilaka as tokens --- Sita shows guarded crest jewel and vows one month life --- Sita warns dread Ravana gaze and threatens instant death on ill news --- Hanuman swears Rama grief-bound and promises Lanka ash --- Hanuman takes jewel bows and grows eager to go --- Sita bids welfare to brothers Sugriva and ministers and safe journey
